  "body": "## Outcome\n\n**BLOCKED / DRAFT / DO NOT MERGE.** Repaired Earthborne Rangers intake packet for the `solo_rpg` cohort. This PR contains no canonical staging tree, no approval, and no promotion.\n\n- Prior audited head: `8ffca761866cf0e739b272177ff76bca748324d6`\n- Repaired head: `acb4825d2f3d996dc3375f380b1554dd3b57171c`\n- Base: `e0e47b2f7593f5ee34c25c5695be9b6bed172afd`\n\n## Exact edition boundary\n\nCurrent corrected English digital core plus **Lure of the Valley**, represented by the official 48-page 2024 `EBR001_Rulebook_web.pdf` and current living campaign guide. First-print material identified by official box code `LFCACD30` is comparison only. Rulebook and Lure-guide corrections already integrated into those current sources are not double-counted.\n\nExcluded except where a mixed row also governs target play: Legacy of the Ancestors, Stewards of the Valley, Moments on the Path, Moments in the Valley, Spire in Bloom, and Shadow of the Storm.\n\n## Item-level source repair\n\n`source-inventory.json` records per-item final URL, retrieval time, status, media type, byte length, SHA-256, classification, and concise basis without mirroring full copyrighted text.\n\n- Lure guide: **96/96** immediate items acquired and classified core/Lure.\n- Glossary: **22 categories / 148 unique leaf URLs**, all classified:\n  - 126 core/Lure\n  - 5 mixed core/Lure + later product\n  - 6 Legacy\n  - 3 Stewards\n  - 3 Moments\n  - 5 other later Valley expansions\n  - target-applicable: **131**; excluded later-only: **17**\n- FAQ: **33/33 Q&As across 11 section headings** classified:\n  - 31 target\n  - 1 target-applicable mixed\n  - 1 Moments-only excluded\n- Card updates: **16/16** pages acquired; **14** core/Lure included; the two explicit `LoA Mission Set` cards excluded.\n- Lure guide updates: **35/35** acquired and classified historical/integrated; not counted again.\n- Rulebook update: acquired and classified first-print comparison for `LFCACD30`; not counted again.\n- Printable errata: official two-page `Card_Errata_eng_web.pdf`, **1,328,433 bytes**, SHA-256 `395142fb44dc5ff6daffe3541effea96bedb30d5cbd61ce7d94ac5f00b9f7036`; duplicate printable form of the 16 update identities, not an additional count.\n\nArithmetic note: the audit-supplied sequence `A14 B3 C16 D10 E9 F7 G5 H3 I5 K2 L5 M10 N2 O3 P20 R13 S20 T11 U4 V2 W3 Y2` totals 169. Direct unique leaf enumeration yields 148: `A14 B2 C15 D9 E8 F6 G4 H2 I4 K1 L4 M9 N1 O2 P19 R12 S19 T10 U3 V1 W2 Y1`. Both are preserved distinctly rather than forcing contradictory arithmetic.\n\n## Governing denominator\n\nDeduplicated target-applicable public rows acquired:\n\n`1 rulebook + 96 Lure + 131 glossary + 32 FAQ + 14 card updates = 274`\n\nAll 274 public rows are acquired and classified. Total rules coverage is still **UNKNOWN / unscored**, not `274/274`, because the rulebook gives contradictory card text precedence and no authoritative complete distinct-card identity/rules-text denominator was acquired.\n\nManifest values: `rules.recorded = 274`, `rules.known_total = null`, `rules.percent = null`.\n\n## Preserved boundaries\n\n- Physical gameplay-card arithmetic remains `278 + 160 = 438`; `37 + 24 + 4 + 17 + 4 + 4 + 12 = 102`; `438 + 102 = 540`.\n- Distinct factual-record coverage remains **UNKNOWN / unscored** because duplicate-copy deck construction prevents treating 540 as distinct identities.\n- Four source-linked table-state visual receipts remain; no canonical visual files were created.\n- No rating, rank, weight, or numerical complexity claim.\n- Canonical coverage remains 0%; no `canonical/`, `approval.json`, promotion, ready-state transition, or merge.\n\n## Residual request to T\n\nProvide or authorize an authoritative complete current corrected English core-plus-Lure distinct-card identity and rules-text inventory if one exists outside the public resources surface. No public-page retrieval or product-scope ruling remains requested.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Item-ledger assertions: clean (`96 / 148 / 33 / 16 / 35`; all rows classified; receipt hashes and arithmetic verified).\n- Focused intake validation: clean.\n- `node scripts/generate-index.mjs`: exit 0.\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs`: 2,611 files clean; index fresh.\n- Complete local suite: **37 tests, 36 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed**.\n- Committed-head `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base e0e47b2f7593f5ee34c25c5695be9b6bed172afd`: clean.\n- `git diff --check e0e47b2f7593f5ee34c25c5695be9b6bed172afd...HEAD`: clean.\n- Exact-head CI: **SUCCESS**, run [`30664777091`](https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/actions/runs/30664777091), head `acb4825d2f3d996dc3375f380b1554dd3b57171c`.\n\n## Role boundary and receiver\n\nBathcat repaired only this noncanonical blocked packet. A wholly fresh Mennonite context must audit the repaired immutable head, followed by fresh Judge oversight. Bathcat must not approve, promote, mark ready, or merge this PR.\n",
